  "notes": "No idols, limbs or eyes drawn. Light only for the Prophet's ﷺ reliance on Allah at the end (no motif on him). STAGING v4: Staging v4: kept ambient. 193-195 speak of the idols (both tafsirs: the polytheists calling their idols, which neither hear nor follow), which are never drawn, not even as shapes or limbs; every clause about them is negated, conditional or a challenge, and worshippers calling toward an empty side would imply the idol, so no people are drawn. c1: a light plate on 193:4-6 for the guidance named in the verse. c2: no plate; 195:20-26 is the Prophet's challenge (the address), camera only (the earlier light plate on 195:24 is removed)."
